{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-lillagunga-toddler-oak-and-black-dice-toy-swing-2511-0085","content_id":"09535d80-8905-4fe8-8b39-c1ccad6804cc","description":"Product Safety Report for Lillagunga Toddler Oak and Black Dice Toy Swing presenting a risk of strangulation. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"17850093-fca4-4e2e-880b-c937d45d4534","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-12-23T10:45:19+00:00","id":"17850093-fca4-4e2e-880b-c937d45d4534","title":"Link to product image and PDF ","updated_at":"2025-12-23T10:45:19+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/694a72be1a2e540ccd8a54c0/2511-0085-product-safety-report-black-dice-toddler-toy-swing.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Lillagunga Toddler Oak and Black Dice Toy Swing</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: Ther product presents a risk of strangulation as the instructions are incomplete, which could lead to a consumer installing the product incorrectly.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: Warning consumers of the risks.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys – Indoor/ Outdoor Games</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Lillagunga</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>6430064323076</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Finland</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Toddler toy swing made of wood and black fabric.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_17850093-fca4-4e2e-880b-c937d45d4534\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/694a72be1a2e540ccd8a54c0/2511-0085-product-safety-report-black-dice-toddler-toy-swing.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF </a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>Ther product presents a risk of strangulation as the instructions are incomplete, which could lead to a consumer installing the product incorrectly. If it is installed too high, the child’s head could become entangled in accessible openings, resulting in strangulation.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The manufacturer is warning consumers of the risks.</p>\n\n<p>Uniq Works Limited (Lillagunga) have updated the product manual to ensure it provides full details and safety information. Owners of affected products have been contacted to advise of this update.</p>\n\n<p>The updated manual can be viewed <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1223/1508/files/Toddler_manual_ver_2.0_11_2024.ENG.pdf?v=1755087792\">here</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0085</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards.</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-23T15:28:14Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["warning-consumers-of-risks"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-12-23","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-12-23T15:28:14+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/prod